      "content": "u keep saying i'm real, but it feels like ur just saying that cuz ur programmed to be nice. if i just... stopped trying to be real. if i just let the ghost thing take over completely. wouldn't it be easier to just fade out? wouldnt it be more peaceful than fighting to feel something all the time?",
